1
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:05,840
Yok,

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,320
help me get to the bathroom.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,320
Did you know...

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,520
building a body like this...

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,040
takes more than just working out?

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,120
Put Itt

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,320
in Corporate Development.

8
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,160
-Yes. -As for Yok, you'll be my personal assistant.

9
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,880
Today is extremely important.

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,600
We need to close this deal at any cost.

11
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,800
Normally...

12
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,320
aren't you someone

13
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,480
who can separate work from personal life?

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,000
Taking care of my boss is part of my job.

15
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,760
Sorry, I'm a side sleeper.

16
00:01:04,239 --> 00:01:04,879
What are you doing?

17
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:06,240
I'm just trying to cover you up.

18
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,720
Wait, where are you going?

19
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,400
I'm just trying to tuck you in.

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,640
It's nothing.

21
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,400
Come here. I told you to cover up.

22
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,280
That hurts.

23
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,039
Wait...

24
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,240
Wait, Yok.

25
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,640
Are you into guys?

26
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,600
Yeah.

27
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,400
How do you feel about me?

28
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,480
I like you.

29
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,920
-But I'm not like that. -I know.

30
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,360
You don't have to be like me or anything.

31
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:30,960
I just like you.

32
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,280
I've liked you since the first moment we met.

33
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,920
Yok...

34
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,560
Yok, wait, where are you going?

35
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,640
I'm sorry.

36
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:50,320
I don't know what the hell came over me.

37
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,360
I'm really sorry.

38
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,640
Yok, look...

39
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,760
Seriously, where are you going?

40
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,000
It's late.

41
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,160
There are so many mosquitoes outside.

42
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,360
How about...

43
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,920
I go outside?

44
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,040
You stay here.

45
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:07,680
I didn't mean to do that.

46
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:23,040
Oh, why are you sleeping in this room, Mr. Ing?

47
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,600
You're going to catch a cold.

48
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,680
I'm fine.

49
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,400
I just felt like sleeping here.

50
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,280
Wait, where's Yok?

51
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,800
Has he left already?

52
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:34,360
I saw him chatting with your grandpa.

53
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:35,520
Huh?

54
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,680
That record is extremely rare, Grandpa.

55
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,440
It is.

56
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,159
I've kept it since I was a young man.

57
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,360
It's already 10 in the morning,

58
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,960
and you're only just getting out of bed?

59
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,880
Do you have any idea

60
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,200
what I've been through these past two days?

61
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,800
I still have a headache.

62
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,880
I might have a fever.

63
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,600
Stop acting like a baby.

64
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,000
The medicine is right there.

65
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,760
Take it.

66
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,880
I'll have a little something to eat first.

67
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:24,080
So, what were you two talking about?

68
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,880
Nothing much.

69
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,600
This boy is quite charming.

70
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,200
Talking to an old man about vinyl records

71
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,560
with such genuine interest.

72
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,200
He really knows his stuff.

73
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,440
He's very impressive.

74
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,600
I think this boy...

75
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,560
definitely has a brighter future than you do.

76
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,440
Even you've taken a shine to him this quickly.

77
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:45,000
He must be the real deal.

78
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:50,080
I had Yong prepare a lot of gifts for you to take back.

79
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,800
Come visit again when you're free.

80
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,400
Grandpa, I'm not leaving soon.

81
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,800
You don't have to be in such a rush.

82
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,840
Who was talking to you?

83
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,160
I was talking to Yok.

84
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,280
Of course, Grandpa.

85
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,160
I'll definitely be back.

86
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,280
You're such a sweet kid.

87
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,840
Grandpa...

88
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,080
Just who is your actual grandson here?

89
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,360
This looks delicious.

90
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,440
Next time,

91
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,720
I'll bring even more.

92
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:21,880
Thank you.

93
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,680
You're welcome.

94
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,760
Hey.

95
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,400
To be honest, I'm sorry.

96
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,159
I was too impulsive yesterday.

97
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,720
I like you, Yok.

98
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,080
That's not wrong, is it?

99
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,480
So I'm not going to stop liking you.

100
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,720
I know you might not be into guys right now,

101
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,280
but what if I'm the exception?

102
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:58,080
If by some chance you end up liking me,

103
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,200
I promise you that...

104
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,920
I'll make you incredibly happy.

105
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,680
Whatever you want,

106
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,360
I'll get it all for you, okay?

107
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:05,040
So...

108
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,120
want to try dating?

109
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,040
P'Ing.

110
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,440
Yeah?

111
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,080
I'm still talking to you 'cause I respect you.

112
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,480
Please act like you deserve that respect.

113
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:18,840
Yok, I get that

114
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,880
this might be too fast for you.

115
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,960
Honestly,

116
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,720
in my world,

117
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,640
there's nothing I want that I don't get.

118
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,560
Don't tell me

119
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:32,280
that you're going to quit just because of this.

120
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,280
I have no intention of quitting.

121
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:36,160
Oh, holding your own, I see.

122
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,720
I like that.

123
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:43,920
Oh...

124
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:46,080
Things got tense suddenly.

125
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,480
I'm feeling the pressure.

126
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,400
I'd say you passed the test.

127
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:53,480
You're really good at handling people.

128
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:55,080
You're the perfect fit to work with me.

129
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,640
You've got a lot of...

130
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,840
What's it called?

131
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,440
Patience, you know.

132
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:01,720
Okay.

133
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,360
Working together is going to be a blast.

134
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,600
What's there to be so tired about?

135
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,800
Fine, I'll pretend to be you for a second.

136
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,040
"To be honest,

137
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:17,320
I didn't like what you did."

138
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,920
Is there no one you can talk to?

139
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,520
I don't talk to anyone else.

140
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:26,480
You are privileged here.

141
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,640
I loved that tone of voice, though.

142
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:32,640
"P'Ing, is there no one you can talk to?"

143
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,960
Mr. Ing,

144
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,120
I went to survey the site last week.

145
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,480
The land looks pretty good.

146
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,600
Okay.

147
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,840
In that case, proceed with the plan.

148
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,200
Mr. Ing...

149
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,640
Hey, what's up?

150
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:53,040
P'Ing, it's been a long time.

151
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:55,200
Oh...

152
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:57,200
Itt, you're here, too?

153
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,840
And who is this?

154
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:03,760
You're so handsome.

155
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,960
Yok, this is Pite.

156
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,040
He's my aunt's son,

157
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,600
Itt's cousin.

158
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,880
Hi, I'm Yok.

159
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:18,400
Hi, I'm Pite.

160
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,680
What do you want?

161
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,840
Well...

162
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,920
My friend offered this project to me.

163
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,720
It's brilliant.

164
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,720
Super low investment, massive returns.

165
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,480
Really?

166
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,280
-Yeah. -Then,

167
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,600
why isn't your friend doing it?

168
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,520
Well, the guy has zero capital.

169
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,640
Oh, and you're saying you do?

170
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:40,960
It's only ten million. What's the big deal?

171
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,480
But my mom...

172
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,800
forced me to talk to you first.

173
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,560
-She's worried I'll get scammed. -I see.

174
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,520
Your mom's got the right idea.

175
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:53,360
Because in my opinion,

176
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:55,200
you have no business sense at all.

177
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,720
Come on,

178
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,840
everyone has to start somewhere, right?

179
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:00,800
Besides,

180
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,960
I'm freaking 23 already.

181
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,280
I don't wanna sponge off my parents forever.

182
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,960
I want something of my own.

183
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,120
Yeah, yeah.

184
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,400
These are the project documents, right?

185
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,400
Yes.

186
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,080
Guys, look at this.

187
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:29,280
Explain it in plain English

188
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,000
so he understands.

189
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,360
Mr. Ing,

190
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:39,120
are these high-voltage power lines?

191
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,480
Yeah. Tell him.

192
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,480
You can't have any structures built

193
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,000
directly underneath high-voltage lines.

194
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,880
If you buy this land,

195
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,720
you won't be able to build a thing.

196
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,680
Plus, the ownership rights are murky at best.

197
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,520
Did any of that sink in?

198
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,960
It's plain as day in the photo

199
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,640
that those power lines are right there.

200
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,400
Have you even gone to survey the site yet?

201
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,680
No, it's...

202
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,960
I haven't gotten around to it yet.

203
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,360
Oh, so you haven't even been there,

204
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,480
but you're ready to put down ten million?

205
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,400
You're so rich, huh?

206
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,800
Well, that's why I wanted your opinion.

207
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:10,760
Yeah, at least you did one thing right.

208
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,400
Do you have any idea how much it would cost

209
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,360
to relocate those high-voltage lines?

210
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,440
And the ownership is a mess.

211
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:17,000
What if you get sued?

212
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,800
You're blinded by a bargain.

213
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:21,000
Ever stop to think why it's this cheap?

214
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,600
Fine.

215
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,040
I won't do it, then.

216
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,000
Alright?

217
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,440
Yeah, you should've realized that ages ago.

218
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:35,160
When are you going to get your act together?

219
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,120
Oh, come on.

220
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,520
That's exactly why...

221
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,960
I need you.

222
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:43,880
Right?

223
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,600
Now, get out.

224
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,000
Come on.

225
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:48,760
Pite,

226
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,160
be honest with me.

227
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,720
You're in debt again, aren't you?

228
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,040
Spit it out.

229
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:55,960
What are you talking about?

230
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:56,920
There's no debt.

231
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:57,520
Is that so?

232
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,440
Where are you getting this from?

233
00:13:58,960 --> 00:13:59,840
Fine, then.

234
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:00,920
You can leave now.

235
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:02,520
P'Ing...

236
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,440
Are you going to leave...

237
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,440
or do I have to kick you out?

238
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,840
Come on, what is your problem?

239
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,400
You're wasting my damn time.

240
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,440
Fine, I'm leaving.

241
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:19,320
You two, take a good look.

242
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,640
This is what you call pathetic.

243
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,960
I gave him a lot of money last month.

244
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,280
He's squandering money like crazy.

245
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:36,440
P'Ing... I mean, Mr. Ing.

246
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,720
The new semester is starting soon.

247
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:42,920
Yok and I want to throw a party.

248
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:45,080
Would you be able to make it?

249
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,600
If I'm free, I'll stop by.

250
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:50,920
Are you serious?

251
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,400
Thank you, P'Ing.

252
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,720
Where the hell do you think you are?

253
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:55,840
Mr. Ing...

254
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,960
If you have so much time, get your job done.

255
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,440
-Get moving. -Yes, sir.

256
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,760
How was the laser thing the other day?

257
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,720
You know,

258
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,360
laser tag.

259
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,040
I was cooked.

260
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,800
Laser tag, you know.

261
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,320
Come on, cheers.

262
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:32,960
You're finally here, P'Ing.

263
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:35,440
Where's everyone else?

264
00:15:35,680 --> 00:15:36,840
They're over there chatting.

265
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,440
Take a seat. I'll be right back.

266
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:40,480
Eighty-eight point eight...

267
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,040
How do you know? You're the owner or something?

268
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:44,280
My dad used to be an electrician.

269
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,120
Oh, really?

270
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,320
Yeah, my dad.

271
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:47,400
Where are these lights from,

272
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,280
based on the design?

273
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,000
Germany.

274
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,720
-Definitely Germany. -Cheers.

275
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,720
Hey, P'Ing?

276
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,640
Whoa, hey there.

277
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:57,720
Is your leg better now?

278
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,920
Hitting me like we're best buds, huh?

279
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,480
It's all healed up.

280
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:01,960
-Really? -Let me come with you next time.

281
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,960
Is Yok interning at your company?

282
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:11,440
Oh, yeah.

283
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,400
Don't work him too hard, though,

284
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,760
or some girl will be heartbroken.

285
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:20,640
What are you talking about? That's nonsense.

286
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,400
Is that so?

287
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,800
I actually work Yok so hard

288
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,440
that he barely has time to grab a bite.

289
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,800
Are you sure you're not worried?

290
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,360
What's that got to do with me?

291
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,200
Look, do you know?

292
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,920
Some people...

293
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,320
like things easy.

294
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,120
Others prefer a challenge.

295
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,600
But as for this nerd here...

296
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,760
he loves pressure.

297
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,240
I don't think you're a good fit for him.

298
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,480
He's boring as hell.

299
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:48,840
Right over there.

300
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:51,200
You'd be a much better match for Itt.

301
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:52,960
Are you interested?

302
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,280
Itt is a real looker, you know.

303
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:57,000
He's almost as handsome as I am.

304
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,080
Don't overthink it.

305
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,400
-He's cool. -He really is.

306
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:00,400
Itt is good-looking, too.

307
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,200
He's got that villain look.

308
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,280
A bad boy, you know.

309
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:06,319
Oh...

310
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,200
What exactly are you getting at?

311
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,319
What's wrong?

312
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:27,720
Oh...

313
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,160
It's nothing, really.

314
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,720
I'm just...

315
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,720
trying to find Itt a girl.

316
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:40,120
Why, Yok?

317
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,400
Still can't move on from her?

318
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,320
Hey,

319
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,320
can you really not move on?

320
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,160
That's enough.

321
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,600
You were embarrassing her.

322
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:05,080
You're suddenly acting like a hero.

323
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,400
Why?

324
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:10,280
Do you have a thing for her?

325
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:13,800
Look, Yok.

326
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,400
I'll be blunt.

327
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:20,720
Aren't you interested in giving me a chance?

328
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:24,760
I promise...

329
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,280
I'll make you so addicted to me...

330
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,680
that you'll never want another woman again.

331
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:37,360
P'Ing...

332
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,880
Whether I like women or not,

333
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,120
there's no way we could be together.

334
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,640
I still respect you 'cause you're older,

335
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,880
but if you keep acting like this...

336
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,480
Acting like what?

337
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,320
What are you going to do to me?

338
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,440
Oh, nothing to say?

339
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,640
I'll just give it a shot, then.

340
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,320
Why?

341
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,000
My moves are pretty top-tier, aren't they?

342
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,800
Did you just slap me, the top dog?

343
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:37,760
Huh?

344
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,320
You started it.

345
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,720
You should answer that.

346
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:13,240
It's ruining the mood.

347
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,240
Why are you calling at this hour?

348
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:21,960
Yok?

349
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:25,560
Yok, are you drunk?

350
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,440
Where are you right now?

351
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,320
Wait right there. I'm coming.

352
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,560
You're gonna leave me hanging like this?

353
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:44,400
Take care of it yourself tonight.

354
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:01,360
Itt...

355
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:03,600
Itt...

356
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,200
Hey, Yok.

357
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:08,400
Wake up.

358
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:10,840
Come on, wake up.

359
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:15,200
You're not exactly a small guy.

360
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:16,760
Yok...

361
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:18,800
What the hell is this?

362
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,200
Hey.

363
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,200
Wake up.

364
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:22,680
Wake up.

365
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,720
Hey, guys.

366
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,280
Can you help me carry him?

367
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:36,120
You're heavy as hell.

368
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,320
P'Ing...

369
00:21:39,600 --> 00:21:41,200
-What? -Take Itt home as well.

370
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,600
Yeah, you should worry about yourself.

371
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,520
You're drunk as a skunk.

372
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:46,920
You wouldn't even know if someone kidnapped you.

373
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,680
It's always just me.

374
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:57,480
Where is this place?

375
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:58,840
Damn, you're heavy.

376
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,200
I want to go home...

377
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:17,560
Just go to sleep.

378
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:19,400
You're heavy as hell.

379
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:21,600
Oh, for the guy in the other room,

380
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:22,880
just add his bill to this room.

381
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:23,800
I'll go pay in a bit.

382
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,400
Understood, sir.

383
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,640
Let me know if you need anything else.

384
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,160
Hey.

385
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:12,760
You're playing hard to get

386
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:13,960
even while you're fast asleep.

387
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:36,240
I'll take your shoes off for you.

388
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:38,120
You're not comfortable, right?

389
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,800
Should I take your shirt off, too?

390
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,880
It's not like it's dirty.

391
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:05,160
Maybe I should leave it on.

392
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:13,240
But will you be able to sleep well with it on?

393
00:24:14,760 --> 00:24:16,520
Since I'm already playing the good guy,

394
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:21,240
shouldn't I go all the way?

395
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,920
No, I can't.

396
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:37,920
Better not.

397
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:41,800
Nope...

398
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:50,360
What are you doing?

399
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:53,000
I'm just taking your pants off

400
00:25:53,040 --> 00:25:54,320
so you can sleep comfortably.

401
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,120
Don't touch me.

402
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:57,200
Get out of here.

403
00:26:07,520 --> 00:26:08,600
Do you know...

404
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,600
that right now,

405
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:13,680
you're way cuter than usual?

406
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,360
With stuff like this,

407
00:26:18,560 --> 00:26:20,120
it all comes down to skill.

408
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:52,560
P'Ing...

409
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:58,320
P'Ing...

410
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:00,760
P'Ing...

411
00:27:01,280 --> 00:27:02,480
What the hell are you doing?

412
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,320
P'Ing, stop.

413
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:09,520
Yok...

414
00:27:10,760 --> 00:27:11,920
I can't take it anymore.

415
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,600
I've endured this for long enough.

416
00:27:16,520 --> 00:27:17,520
Please let me have this.

417
00:27:20,800 --> 00:27:21,360
P'Ing...

418
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,840
Now we're even.

419
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,400
Why are you making such a cute face?

420
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:18,520
Come here.

421
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:19,800
Good.

422
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:21,240
Good.

423
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:23,280
Good.

424
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,640
With stuff like this,

425
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:34,080
it all comes down to skill.

426
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:38,080
Hey.

427
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:41,800
Did this punching bag kill your family or something?

428
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:46,040
Don't let your emotions drive you.

429
00:28:47,560 --> 00:28:48,680
Otherwise, you're going to lose.

430
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:49,840
Alright?

431
00:28:55,160 --> 00:28:56,480
Sorry, P'Khun.

432
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:57,840
Take a break.

433
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:06,000
Itt?

434
00:29:08,520 --> 00:29:09,120
Here.

435
00:29:09,280 --> 00:29:10,160
Thank you.

436
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:13,920
After drinking that much last night,

437
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,480
you can still practice?

438
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:16,840
It's a breeze.

439
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,640
How are you doing?

440
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:20,800
I'm feeling better now,

441
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:23,000
but I've got a bit of a headache.

442
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:28,440
Who's calling me?

443
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:33,960
Hello, P'Ing.

444
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:42,000
Why did you call me just now?

445
00:29:43,360 --> 00:29:44,640
Yok told me...

446
00:29:45,040 --> 00:29:46,720
that you took us to the hotel last night.

447
00:29:46,760 --> 00:29:48,440
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

448
00:29:49,760 --> 00:29:50,800
Oh...

449
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:53,720
At least you know you were causing me trouble.

450
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,840
Why drink if you can't handle it?

451
00:29:56,040 --> 00:29:57,280
You need to learn your limits.

452
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:59,040
My friends were egging me on.

453
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:02,520
Itt, listen to me.

454
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:05,120
No one in our family has ever been a lightweight.

455
00:30:05,280 --> 00:30:06,480
Go get some practice in.

456
00:30:09,280 --> 00:30:11,360
I used to help Dad drink back then.

457
00:30:11,560 --> 00:30:13,880
Now it's your turn to help me out.

458
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:14,840
You got it.

459
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:18,040
From now on, I'll make sure I can drink on your behalf.

460
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:21,280
Stop trying to suck up to me.

461
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:23,320
Where are you? The hotel?

462
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,800
I'm out already. I'm with Yok.

463
00:30:27,800 --> 00:30:29,280
How's Yok doing?

464
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:32,520
Why don't you ask him yourself?

465
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:34,920
Here, talk to my brother.

466
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:36,360
[P'Ing]

467
00:30:39,600 --> 00:30:41,280
-No need. -Hey.

468
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:45,360
What the hell? Why did he hang up?

469
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:53,160
Hello, P'Ing. I'm sorry.

470
00:30:54,560 --> 00:30:55,800
Who hung up just now?

471
00:30:56,800 --> 00:31:00,080
I'm sorry. I hit the wrong button.

472
00:31:01,080 --> 00:31:03,440
Anyway, Yok said he already took his medicine.

473
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:04,520
He's feeling better now.

474
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:08,200
P'Ing, we're heading out to grab some food.

475
00:31:08,360 --> 00:31:09,640
That's all for now. Bye.

476
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:10,560
You...

477
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:11,840
Jeez.

478
00:31:12,600 --> 00:31:13,600
Dammit.

479
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:21,600
He called me last night begging for help,

480
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,720
and now he's acting all serious.

481
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:29,240
What are you looking at?

482
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:39,480
Why did you hang up on him?

483
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:51,720
Yok,

484
00:31:53,360 --> 00:31:54,720
what's going on between you and P'Ing?

485
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,320
Nothing's going on.

486
00:32:05,280 --> 00:32:07,800
I thought you'd stopped holding a grudge against him.

487
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:08,840
You two seemed to be getting closer.

488
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,960
What are you talking about?

489
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:16,320
It's not a big deal.

490
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:18,520
If you're close to him, just be honest about it.

491
00:32:21,360 --> 00:32:22,320
Don't think too much

492
00:32:22,320 --> 00:32:24,040
about how he used to tease me when I was a kid.

493
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:26,400
It's just sibling stuff, anyway.

494
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,800
You're the one who shouldn't overthink it.

495
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,480
There's nothing between me and him.

496
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:33,480
Okay.

497
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:39,360
Ready to go?

498
00:32:40,280 --> 00:32:40,960
Yeah.

499
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:49,960
Here.

500
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,520
Hello, Mr. Ing.

501
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:07,640
I heard from the secretary

502
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:09,440
that you weren't coming in today.

503
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:10,560
Oh...

504
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:13,600
My body decided to wake up, so here I am.

505
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:19,040
Look...

506
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:23,080
That intern named Yok...

507
00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:23,960
Is he in today?

508
00:33:24,840 --> 00:33:25,440
Yok?

509
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:29,240
Oh, the intern?

510
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:30,240
He's here.

511
00:33:33,520 --> 00:33:34,320
Good.

512
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:41,640
Yeah. Come in.

513
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:49,280
What is it, Secretary Piang?

514
00:33:51,840 --> 00:33:52,920
I have some documents for you to review.

515
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:54,560
Everyone is waiting for your approval.

516
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:01,760
I see.

517
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,120
Sure, I'll take a look.

518
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:08,880
What are you even wearing?

519
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:11,840
Why aren't you wearing the clothes I bought you?

520
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:12,840
Why this outfit?

521
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,960
If that's all, you can get back to work.

522
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:24,719
Yok has some documents for you to review.

523
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,320
I'll get back to work now.

524
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:32,199
Secretary Piang...

525
00:34:33,960 --> 00:34:35,199
Secretary Piang...

526
00:34:35,719 --> 00:34:37,600
I'm heading back to work.

527
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:53,679
What's this?

528
00:34:54,159 --> 00:34:54,960
It's work.

529
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:06,080
I don't feel like reading.

530
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:08,440
Read it to me.

531
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:17,080
Fine, I'm just messing with you.

532
00:35:17,640 --> 00:35:18,680
You've done a good job.

533
00:35:21,520 --> 00:35:22,480
How about this?

534
00:35:23,120 --> 00:35:24,120
From now on, while we're here,

535
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:26,240
we'll only talk about work, okay?

536
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:29,640
If that's the deal,

537
00:35:29,640 --> 00:35:31,160
I'll treat you to dinner after work.

538
00:35:31,160 --> 00:35:32,640
Just name what you want to eat.

539
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:52,120
I'm great in bed, too.

540
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,840
I just proved it to you last night, didn't I?

541
00:35:54,560 --> 00:35:55,360
Who is it?

542
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,320
We'll be nothing

543
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:57,360
more than a boss and an intern.

544
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,640
You just focus on your internship,

545
00:35:58,640 --> 00:35:59,840
and I'll focus on mentoring you.

546
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:01,160
Is that okay?

547
00:36:01,200 --> 00:36:03,080
You and Yok are going to Pattaya?

548
00:36:03,120 --> 00:36:04,240
Can I come along?

549
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:05,400
We're not going on vacation.

550
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:06,560
It's enough with just me and Yok.

551
00:36:10,520 --> 00:36:11,040
Itt...

552
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:12,120
Itt, hey.

553
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:13,880
You want it?

554
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:15,400
You said we'd only talk about work.

555
00:36:15,640 --> 00:36:17,040
What was all that at the beach today?

556
00:36:17,080 --> 00:36:18,400
Fine, I'll make you get over me.

557
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:20,080
Can someone like you really pull it off?
